      "id": "2026-11-09-vllm-pr-57810",
      "event_key": "vllm-pr-57810",
      "title": "vLLM：交还 GPU 时，可保留同权重的外置 KV",
      "summary": "固定合入5efb24d新增reset_connector选项，将设备KV回收与连接器缓存清空解耦；默认True。保留时同步EngineCore先推进尚未完成的连接器写入，再同步设备和重置缓存，恢复同权重请求可利用外置块。合入接口与PR早期clear_connector_cache叙述不同，以固定代码为准。",
      "source_urls": [
        "https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/pulls/57810",
        "https://api.github.com/repos/vllm-project/vllm/pulls/57810/files?per_page=100",
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vllm-project/vllm/5efb24d5420b1f28737e4e8d1b62b354ddc18069/vllm/v1/engine/core.py"
      ],
      "update_of": null,
      "article_id": "inference-engines"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-09-sglang-pr-48852",
      "event_key": "sglang-pr-48852",
      "title": "SGLang：逻辑释放与物理复用分开，避免多卡选页随时序漂移",
      "summary": "固定合入de363613将统一延迟整理池的物理页绑定到最近未处理的已记录forward事件；逻辑ID先归还，结果按序同步后释放物理页。提前分配仅等待所需pending批次；容量按逻辑计数包含pending页，避免按本地event.query完成时序使不同TP rank选页漂移。",
      "source_urls": [
        "https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/pulls/48852",
        "https://api.github.com/repos/sgl-project/sglang/pulls/48852/files?per_page=100",
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sgl-project/sglang/de3636131d1727b1397be98a42d58d5db95a0936/python/sglang/srt/mem_cache/kv/alloc/forward_steps.py"
      ],
      "update_of": null,
      "article_id": "inference-engines"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-09-groot-fast-loader-7aa0bca",
      "event_key": "groot-fast-loader-7aa0bca",
      "title": "GR00T：流式加载与按需解码减少训练等数据",
      "summary": "固定提交7aa0bca的fast loader保持分片计划、样本构造与processor，改用连续episode小块加载、约一分片滚动shuffle buffer、仅解码采样所需帧与有界FFmpeg线程。给定seed取样顺序不依赖解码先后，但并非与stock逐batch等价。",
      "source_urls": [
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NVIDIA/Isaac-GR00T/7aa0bca50f1097f8b17f5c274c98264b72a1419f/gr00t/data/dataset/fast_sharded_dataset.py",
        "https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/Isaac-GR00T/commits/7aa0bca50f10",
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NVIDIA/Isaac-GR00T/7aa0bca50f1097f8b17f5c274c98264b72a1419f/README.md",
        "https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA/Isaac-GR00T/releases?per_page=5"
      ],
      "update_of": null,
      "article_id": "embodied-training"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-09-lmcache-pr-5770",
      "event_key": "lmcache-pr-5770",
      "title": "LMCache：在gRPC解析前拒绝无效凭证",
      "summary": "合入a9db748为同步和aio gRPC复用已有API key验证；拒绝路径省略protobuf反序列化，错误凭证在业务handler前失败。native模式配置密钥时拒绝启动，无key兼容无认证。该改动控制RPC准入，不承担TLS或租户对象隔离。",
      "source_urls": [
        "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LMCache/LMCache/a9db748507898234ffe8a2185d512e0a3719f554/lmcache/v1/multiprocess/transport/grpc_impl/auth.py",
