      "id": "2026-11-09-arxiv-2611-07542-v1",
      "event_key": "arxiv-2611-07542-v1",
      "title": "FlashOffloading：把KV容量收益与回载等待分开核算",
      "summary": "FlashOffloading按阶段分开KV回载：prefill一层常驻、三层缓冲轮换；decode主机保存完整KV、设备保留热点和indexer，逆索引/LIM/CopySFA减少查缺失与回载暴露时间。64K输出吞吐3787到6358 token/s的同时平均TPOT16.9到30.2ms，容量收益并非无代价。",
      "source_urls": [
        "https://arxiv.org/html/2611.07542v1",
        "https://export.arxiv.org/api/query?search_query=%28all%3A%22KV+cache%22+OR+all%3A%22GPU+oversubscription%22+OR+all%3A%22model+serving%22%29+AND+submittedDate%3A%5B202611010000+TO+202611082328%5D&start=0&max_results=20&sortBy=submittedDate&sortOrder=descending",
